{
  "_comment": "PortableDoc render limits. `docs`: worst-case docs every reader renders under its time bound. `edges`: small docs at and past each limit; gen_pd_parity renders each into goldens/limits/. Macros: {\"$repeat\": n, \"of\": x} is a list of n copies; {\"$text\": s, \"times\": n} is s repeated; {\"$concat\": [...]} joins lists or strings; {\"$nest\": n, \"wrap\": w, \"leaf\": x} puts x in w's \"$hole\" n times.",
